title: "Coastal bloom redistribution: regional physical diagnostics (Benguela and Gulf Stream, 2003–2020)"
abstract: "Eddy-occurrence, offshore-current and Ekman-divergence diagnostics on 10 km coastal rings for Benguela and the Gulf Stream, January 2003–December 2020, with code, figure inputs and trend tables reproducing three figures (eddies, currents and Ekman, eddy polarity)."
